OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry but
OL,6,Fcloudy with bright spells in the east.
OL,7,FCloud will thicken from late morning
OL,8,Fwith the chance of the occasional
OL,9,Fshower during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with the chance of a
OL,12,Ffew evening showers west otherwise dry
OL,13,Fwith increasing clear spells becoming
OL,14,Fcloudy again towards morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FCloudy but dry at first in the
OL,17,Fmorning then rain spreads east
OL,18,Fbecoming locally heavy later in the
OL,19,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
